<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>Читай-ка! — слоги за 1 минуту</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Unbounded:wght@600;800&family=Nunito:wght@400;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --ink:#22304a;
    --blue:#2f6fe0; --blue-bg:#e3edff;
    --red:#ff5a5f;  --red-bg:#ffe7e7;
    --green:#2fbf71; --yellow:#ffd23f;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent}
  html,body{margin:0;padding:0}
  body{
    font-family:'Nunito',Arial,sans-serif;color:var(--ink);
    background:linear-gradient(180deg,#c9e8ff 0%,#e9f7ff 55%,#fdfef2 100%);
    min-height:100vh;min-height:100dvh;overflow-x:hidden;touch-action:manipulation;
  }
  button{font-family:inherit;color:inherit;cursor:pointer}
  .off{display:none !important}

  #errbox{display:none;position:fixed;top:8px;left:8px;right:8px;z-index:99;
    background:#ffd6d6;border:3px solid #c0392b;border-radius:12px;
    padding:10px 14px;font-weight:800;font-size:13px;color:#7a1f1f}

  .sky{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;overflow:hidden;pointer-events:none;z-index:0}
  .sun{position:absolute;top:-46px;right:-46px;width:170px;height:170px;border-radius:50%;
       background:var(--yellow);border:4px solid var(--ink)}
  .sun:before{content:'';position:absolute;top:-46px;left:-46px;right:-46px;bottom:-46px;border-radius:50%;
       background:repeating-conic-gradient(rgba(255,210,63,.35) 0 9deg,transparent 9deg 18deg);
       animation:spin 46s linear infinite}
  @keyframes spin{to{transform:rotate(360deg)}}
  .cloud{position:absolute;left:-240px;background:#fff;border-radius:999px;opacity:.9}
  .cloud:before,.cloud:after{content:'';position:absolute;background:#fff;border-radius:50%}
  .c1{top:12%;width:150px;height:46px;animation:drift 52s linear infinite}
  .c1:before{width:64px;height:64px;top:-30px;left:22px}
  .c1:after{width:44px;height:44px;top:-20px;left:78px}
  .c2{top:38%;width:110px;height:36px;opacity:.75;animation:drift 74s linear infinite;animation-delay:-30s}
  .c2:before{width:48px;height:48px;top:-22px;left:16px}
  .c2:after{width:34px;height:34px;top:-14px;left:56px}
  .c3{top:70%;width:170px;height:50px;opacity:.6;animation:drift 90s linear infinite;animation-delay:-60s}
  .c3:before{width:70px;height:70px;top:-34px;left:26px}
  .c3:after{width:50px;height:50px;top:-22px;left:92px}
  @keyframes drift{to{transform:translateX(150vw)}}
  .fl{position:absolute;font-weight:900;opacity:.14;animation:floaty 9s ease-in-out infinite alternate}
  @keyframes floaty{from{transform:translateY(0)}to{transform:translateY(-30px)}}
  @keyframes bob{50%{transform:translateY(-7px)}}

  .app{position:relative;z-index:1;max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;min-height:100vh;min-height:100dvh;
       display:flex;flex-direction:column;padding:14px 16px 18px}

  header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}
  .logo{display:flex;align-items:center;
        font-family:'Unbounded',Arial,sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:17px;letter-spacing:-.5px}
  .logo-badge{width:38px;height:38px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
        background:var(--yellow);border:3px solid var(--ink);border-radius:11px;font-size:19px;
        color:var(--blue);margin-right:10px;transform:rotate(-6deg);box-shadow:0 4px 0 rgba(34,48,74,.25)}
  .logo em{font-style:normal;color:var(--red)}
  .top-right{display:flex;align-items:center}
  .score{display:flex;align-items:center;background:#fff;border:3px solid var(--ink);border-radius:999px;
        padding:6px 13px;font-weight:900;font-size:15px;box-shadow:0 4px 0 rgba(34,48,74,.2);margin-right:10px}
  .gear{width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:50%;background:#fff;border:3px solid var(--ink);
        font-size:20px;line-height:1;box-shadow:0 4px 0 rgba(34,48,74,.2)}
  .gear:active{transform:scale(.9)}

  .stage{flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
        padding:14px 0;user-select:none;-webkit-user-select:none;-webkit-touch-callout:none}

  .start-panel{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;text-align:center;width:100%}
  .big-clock{font-size:64px;animation:bob 2.4s ease-in-out infinite}
  .start-title{font-family:'Unbounded',Arial,sans-serif;font-weight:800;
        font-size:19px;font-size:clamp(18px,5.2vw,25px);line-height:1.45;margin:14px 8px 28px}
  .start-title em{font-style:normal;color:var(--ink);background:var(--yellow);padding:1px 10px;
        border-radius:10px;border:3px solid var(--ink);display:inline-block;transform:rotate(-2deg)}
  .btn-start{background:var(--green);color:#fff;border:4px solid var(--ink);border-radius:22px;
        padding:20px 52px;font-family:'Unbounded',Arial,sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:24px;
        letter-spacing:.04em;box-shadow:0 9px 0 rgba(34,48,74,.3);animation:pulse 1.7s ease-in-out infinite}
  .btn-start:active{transform:translateY(7px);box-shadow:0 2px 0 rgba(34,48,74,.3);animation:none}
  @keyframes pulse{50%{transform:scale(1.05)}}
  .best-chip{margin-top:24px;background:#fff;border:3px solid var(--ink);border-radius:999px;
        padding:9px 18px;font-weight:900;box-shadow:0 4px 0 rgba(34,48,74,.2)}

  .run-view{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;width:100%}
  .hint{font-weight:800;font-size:13px;color:#5f7095;text-align:center;margin:0 0 12px;transition:opacity .6s}
  .hint.off{opacity:0}
  .hud{display:flex;margin-bottom:10px}
  .pill{background:#fff;border:3px solid var(--ink);border-radius:999px;padding:8px 16px;margin:0 5px;
        font-weight:900;font-size:15px;box-shadow:0 4px 0 rgba(34,48,74,.2);display:flex;align-items:center}
  .pill b{font-size:19px;margin-left:6px}
  .timebar{width:100%;max-width:420px;height:16px;border:3px solid var(--ink);border-radius:999px;
        background:#fff;overflow:hidden;margin-bottom:18px}
  .timebar i{display:block;height:100%;width:100%;background:var(--green);transition:width .2s linear}
  .timebar i.warn{background:#ffb300}
  .timebar i.danger{background:var(--red)}

  .card{background:#fff;border:4px solid var(--ink);border-radius:34px 40px 34px 42px;
    padding:26px 46px;box-shadow:0 14px 0 rgba(34,48,74,.16);
    transform:rotate(-2deg);transition:transform .15s;text-align:center;cursor:pointer}
  .card:active{transform:rotate(-2deg) scale(.95) translateY(8px)}
  .syl{display:block;font-weight:900;line-height:.95;letter-spacing:.02em;
       font-size:96px;font-size:clamp(84px,34vw,220px)}
  .syl.pop{animation:pop .45s cubic-bezier(.2,1.4,.4,1)}
  @keyframes pop{0%{transform:scale(.35) rotate(9deg);opacity:0}
    60%{transform:scale(1.1);opacity:1}100%{transform:scale(1)}}
  .ltr-c{color:var(--blue)} .ltr-v{color:var(--red)}
  .scheme{display:flex;justify-content:center;margin-top:20px}
  .sq{width:24px;height:24px;border:3px solid var(--ink);border-radius:7px;margin:0 7px}
  .sq-c{background:var(--blue)} .sq-v{background:var(--red)}

  .actions{display:flex;width:100%;max-width:420px;margin-top:20px}
  .btn{flex:1;border:3px solid var(--ink);border-radius:18px;padding:15px 8px;
       font-weight:900;font-size:15.5px;box-shadow:0 6px 0 rgba(34,48,74,.3);
       transition:transform .1s;margin:0 6px}
  .btn:active{transform:translateY(5px);box-shadow:0 1px 0 rgba(34,48,74,.3)}
  .btn-speak{background:var(--yellow)}
  .btn-next{background:var(--green);color:#fff}
  .talking{animation:talk .35s ease-in-out 2}
  @keyframes talk{50%{transform:scale(1.09)}}
  .range-note{font-weight:800;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;
       color:#6c7da3;margin-top:14px;text-align:center}

  .result-back{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;background:rgba(34,48,74,.5);
       z-index:26;opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:opacity .4s}
  .result-back.show{opacity:1;pointer-events:auto}
  .result{position:fixed;left:50%;top:50%;z-index:27;width:92%;max-width:420px;
       background:#fff;border:4px solid var(--ink);border-radius:28px;padding:24px 22px;
       text-align:center;box-shadow:0 16px 0 rgba(34,48,74,.2);
       transform:translate(-50%,-50%) scale(.6);opacity:0;visibility:hidden;pointer-events:none;
       transition:all .45s cubic-bezier(.2,1.4,.4,1)}
  .result.show{transform:translate(-50%,-50%) scale(1);opacity:1;visibility:visible;pointer-events:auto}
  .res-emoji{font-size:54px}
  .result h2{font-family:'Unbounded',Arial,sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:21px;margin:8px 0 2px}
  .res-stars{font-size:34px;letter-spacing:6px;margin:4px 0}
  .res-stars .st{color:#dde3f0}
  .res-stars .st.on{color:#ffb300}
  .res-num{font-family:'Unbounded',Arial,sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:72px;line-height:1;
       color:var(--blue);margin-top:4px}
  .res-label{font-weight:900;color:#5f7095;margin-top:2px}
  .res-msg{font-weight:800;margin-top:10px;font-size:15px}
  .res-record{display:inline-block;margin-top:10px;background:var(--yellow);border:3px solid var(--ink);
       border-radius:999px;padding:6px 16px;font-weight:900;animation:pulse 1.2s ease-in-out infinite}
  .btn-again{width:100%;margin-top:18px;background:var(--green);color:#fff;border:3px solid var(--ink);
       border-radius:18px;padding:16px;font-weight:900;font-size:18px;box-shadow:0 6px 0 rgba(34,48,74,.3)}
  .btn-again:active{transform:translateY(4px);box-shadow:0 1px 0 rgba(34,48,74,.3)}
  .btn-mini-settings{margin-top:10px;border:none;background:none;font-weight:800;
       color:#7c8aa9;text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px}

  .backdrop{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;background:rgba(34,48,74,.45);opacity:0;
       pointer-events:none;transition:opacity .35s;z-index:28}
  .backdrop.open{opacity:1;pointer-events:auto}
  .sheet{position:fixed;left:50%;bottom:0;width:100%;max-width:560px;z-index:30;
       background:#fff;border:3px solid var(--ink);border-bottom:none;
       border-radius:28px 28px 0 0;max-height:88vh;overflow-y:auto;
       padding:10px 20px 26px;margin-left:-50%;
       transform:translateY(110%);transition:transform .5s cubic-bezier(.22,1.25,.36,1)}
  .sheet.open{transform:translateY(0)}
  @media(min-width:561px){.sheet{margin-left:-280px}}
  .handle{width:48px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#c9d3e6;margin:6px auto 14px}
  .sheet-head{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}
  .sheet-head h2{font-family:'Unbounded',Arial,sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:19px;margin:0}
  .close{width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:50%;border:3px solid var(--ink);background:var(--red-bg);
       font-weight:900;font-size:17px;box-shadow:0 3px 0 rgba(34,48,74,.25)}

  .sec{margin-top:24px}
  .sec-title{font-family:'Unbounded',Arial,sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:11.5px;letter-spacing:.14em;
       text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:12px}
  .dot{width:11px;height:11px;border-radius:4px;border:2.5px solid var(--ink);display:inline-block;
       vertical-align:-1px;margin-right:8px}
  .dot-c{background:var(--blue)} .dot-v{background:var(--red)}

  .presets{margin-top:16px}
  .preset{border:2.5px solid var(--ink);background:#fff;border-radius:999px;
       padding:7px 13px;font-weight:800;font-size:13px;box-shadow:0 3px 0 rgba(34,48,74,.18);
       margin:4px 6px 0 0}
  .preset:active{background:var(--yellow)}
  .count{font-size:12.5px;font-weight:800;color:#5f7095;margin-top:10px}

  .cstrip{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;padding-top:14px;
       user-select:none;-webkit-user-select:none;-webkit-touch-callout:none}
  .cc{position:relative;min-width:30px;height:44px;flex:1;margin:3px;
       display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
       border:3px solid rgba(34,48,74,.25);border-radius:12px;font-weight:900;font-size:17px;
       background:#eef1f8;color:#a3aec8;transition:background .2s,color .2s,border-color .2s}
  .cc.on{background:var(--blue-bg);border-color:var(--ink);color:var(--blue)}
  .hbadge{position:absolute;top:-15px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);
       font-size:10px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.04em;background:var(--yellow);
       border:2.5px solid var(--ink);border-radius:8px;padding:3px 7px;color:var(--ink);
       white-space:nowrap;cursor:grab;touch-action:none;z-index:2;
       box-shadow:0 3px 0 rgba(34,48,74,.3)}
  body.dragging{cursor:grabbing}
  body.dragging .hbadge{transform:translateX(-50%) scale(1.18);box-shadow:0 5px 0 rgba(34,48,74,.3)}

  .vchips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .vc{position:relative;min-width:42px;height:44px;flex:1;margin:4px;
       border-radius:12px;border:3px solid rgba(34,48,74,.25);background:#eef1f8;color:#a3aec8;
       font-weight:900;font-size:18px}
  .vc.on{background:var(--red-bg);border-color:var(--ink);color:var(--red)}
  .vc:active{transform:scale(.92)}
  .sub-note{font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#8b98b5;margin-top:8px}

  .seg{display:flex;border:3px solid var(--ink);border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden}
  .seg button{flex:1;padding:12px 2px;border:none;background:#fff;
       font-weight:800;font-size:13px;border-right:3px solid var(--ink)}
  .seg button:last-child{border-right:none}
  .seg button.active{background:var(--yellow)}

  .switch-row{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;
       border:3px solid var(--ink);border-radius:16px;padding:13px 16px;background:#fffdf4}
  .switch-row span{font-weight:800;font-size:14.5px}
  .sw{position:relative;width:58px;height:32px;display:inline-block}
  .sw input{position:absolute;opacity:0;width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;z-index:2}
  .track{position:absolute;top:0;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;border:3px solid var(--ink);border-radius:999px;
       background:#dde4f1;transition:background .25s}
  .knob{position:absolute;top:5px;left:5px;width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:50%;
       background:#fff;border:3px solid var(--ink);transition:transform .25s;z-index:1}
  .sw input:checked ~ .track{background:var(--green)}
  .sw input:checked ~ .knob{transform:translateX(24px)}

  .btn-test{width:100%;margin-top:12px;border:3px solid var(--ink);background:var(--blue-bg);
       border-radius:14px;padding:13px;font-weight:900;font-size:14.5px;
       box-shadow:0 4px 0 rgba(34,48,74,.2)}
  .btn-test:active{transform:translateY(3px);box-shadow:none}

  .done{width:100%;margin-top:26px;background:var(--green);color:#fff;border:3px solid var(--ink);
       border-radius:18px;padding:16px;font-weight:900;font-size:17px;box-shadow:0 6px 0 rgba(34,48,74,.3)}
  .done:active{transform:translateY(4px)}
  .mini-reset{text-align:center;margin-top:14px}
  .mini-reset button{border:none;background:none;font-weight:800;font-size:12.5px;
       color:#7c8aa9;text-decoration:underline;margin:0 8px}

  #fx{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;pointer-events:none;z-index:36}
  .pt{position:fixed;left:0;top:0;font-weight:900}
  .toast{position:fixed;top:16px;left:50%;z-index:45;
       transform:translate(-50%,-90px);
       background:#fff;border:3px solid var(--ink);border-radius:16px;padding:11px 20px;
       font-weight:900;font-size:14px;box-shadow:0 6px 0 rgba(34,48,74,.25);
       transition:transform .45s;max-width:92vw;text-align:center}
  .toast.show{transform:translate(-50%,0)}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div id="errbox"></div>
<noscript><div style="padding:20px;font-weight:800">Для работы сайта нужен включённый JavaScript.</div></noscript>

<div class="sky">
  <div class="sun"></div>
  <div class="cloud c1"></div><div class="cloud c2"></div><div class="cloud c3"></div>
  <div id="flyers"></div>
</div>

<div class="app">
  <header>
    <div class="logo"><span class="logo-badge">А</span><span>ЧИТАЙ<em>‑КА!</em></span></div>
    <div class="top-right">
      <div class="score">🏆 <b id="bestTop">0</b></div>
      <button class="gear" id="btnSettings" aria-label="Настройки">⚙</button>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="stage" id="stage">

    <div class="start-panel" id="startPanel">
      <div class="big-clock">⏱</div>
      <h1 class="start-title">Прочитай как можно больше слогов за <em>1 минуту</em></h1>
      <button class="btn-start" id="btnStart">СТАРТ ▶</button>
      <div class="best-chip">🏆 Рекорд: <b id="bestVal">0</b> слогов</div>
      <p class="tip" id="tip" style="font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700;color:#68799e;min-height:20px;transition:opacity .4s"></p>
    </div>

    <div class="run-view off" id="runView">
      <p class="hint" id="hint">👆 нажимай на экран: слог озвучится и появится новый</p>
      <div class="hud">
        <div class="pill">⏱ <b id="timeLeft">1:00</b></div>
        <div class="pill">📖 <b id="roundCount">0</b></div>
      </div>
      <div class="timebar"><i id="timefill"></i></div>

      <div class="card" id="card">
        <span class="syl" id="syl"><span class="ltr-c" id="l1">б</span><span class="ltr-v" id="l2">а</span></span>
        <span class="scheme"><i class="sq sq-c"></i><i class="sq sq-v"></i></span>
      </div>

      <div class="actions">
        <button class="btn btn-speak" id="btnSpeak">🔊 Послушать</button>
        <button class="btn btn-next" id="btnNext">Дальше ➜</button>
      </div>
      <div class="range-note" id="rangeNote"></div>
    </div>

  </main>
</div>

<div class="result-back" id="resultBack"></div>
<div class="result" id="result">
  <div class="res-emoji">⏰</div>
  <h2>Время вышло!</h2>
  <div class="res-stars" id="resStars"></div>
  <div class="res-num" id="resNum">0</div>
  <div class="res-label">слогов за минуту</div>
  <div class="res-msg" id="resMsg"></div>
  <span class="res-record off" id="resRecord">🎉 Новый рекорд!</span>
  <button class="btn-again" id="btnAgain">🔄 Повторить</button><br>
  <button class="btn-mini-settings" id="btnResSettings">⚙ Настройки</button>
</div>

<div class="backdrop" id="backdrop"></div>

<section class="sheet" id="sheet">
  <div class="handle"></div>
  <div class="sheet-head">
    <h2>Настройки</h2>
    <button class="close" id="btnClose">✕</button>
  </div>

  <div class="sec">
    <div class="sec-title"><span class="dot dot-c"></span>Согласные: от… до…</div>
    <div class="sub-note" style="margin:0 0 4px">Зажмите метку «ОТ» или «ДО» (или букву под ней) и, не отрывая пальца, проведите до нужной буквы</div>
    <div class="cstrip" id="cstrip"></div>
    <div class="presets">
      <button class="preset" data-range="0-1">Б–В</button>
      <button class="preset" data-range="0-3">Старт: Б–Д</button>
      <button class="preset" data-range="0-9">Б–М</button>
      <button class="preset" data-range="0-20">Все согласные</button>
    </div>
    <div class="count" id="count"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="sec">
    <div class="sec-title"><span class="dot dot-v"></span>Гласные</div>
    <div class="vchips" id="vchips"></div>
    <div class="sub-note">Остальные гласные удобно добавить на следующем этапе</div>
  </div>

  <div class="sec">
    <div class="sec-title">🔤 Какие буквы показывать</div>
    <div class="seg" id="caseSeg">
      <button data-case="upper">БОЛЬШИЕ</button>
      <button data-case="lower">маленькие</button>
      <button data-case="mix">вперемешку</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="sec">
    <div class="sec-title">🎧 Звук</div>
    <div class="switch-row">
      <span>Озвучивать слог при нажатии</span>
      <label class="sw"><input type="checkbox" id="voiceChk"><i class="track"></i><i class="knob"></i></label>
    </div>
    <button class="btn-test" id="btnTestVoice">🎤 Проверить озвучку</button>
    <div class="sub-note">Если звука нет: Android — Настройки → Язык и ввод → Синтез речи (русский голос). iPhone — Настройки → Универсальный доступ → Устный контент → Голоса → Русский.</div>
  </div>

  <button class="done" id="btnDone">Готово ✔</button>
  <div class="mini-reset">
    <button id="resetBest">сбросить рекорд 🏆</button>
    <button id="resetAll">настройки по у
